/*
  RecoveryUnlinkNoContext — privacy pair A calibration: the genesis
  context is deleted from the recovery-key derivation (mrk1(code)
  instead of member_recovery_key(code, genesis_id)). Bead auto-u8pcx
  (spike: auto-pdvu6). Tracker 8277c76c.

  LEFT now publishes the SAME public key for both organizations;
  RIGHT publishes two different ones. Run with
  `tamarin-prover --diff --prove`: Observational_equivalence MUST be
  falsified — the observer's equality test on the two published keys
  is exactly the cross-organization link the genesis context exists
  to kill. This falsification is what makes the green theory's
  verified verdict evidence rather than vacuity.
*/

theory RecoveryUnlinkNoContext
begin

builtins: signing

functions: mrk1/1

rule Publish_Two_Orgs:
  [ Fr(~code), Fr(~code2), Fr(~g1), Fr(~g2) ]
  -->
  [ Out(~g1), Out(~g2)
  , Out(pk(mrk1(~code)))
  , Out(pk(mrk1(diff(~code, ~code2))))
  ]

end
